The [[Strong Heroic Potion]] is a neutral [[Potion]] normally obtained by combining a [[Heroic Potion]] with a [[Banana]], although [[Reaper]]s can also catalytically convert the [[Heroic Potion]] into the [[Strong Heroic Potion]] using the [[Cauldron]]. When the player runs out of stamina the [[Strong Heroic Potion]] is consumed, regenerating 4 stamina and gaining 1 {{icon/empower}}, as well as applying the effect of the [[Potion]] above it. It is mostly useless (other than from potion spillover) unless the build is well-exceeding 1.0 stamina per second, and having higher stamina demands will make it more likely to trigger and/or cause it to trigger more quickly.

The single {{icon/empower}} the [[Heroic Potion]] and [[Strong Heroic Potion]] can provide may seem fairly minor, but with potion spillover, [[Amulet of Alchemy]], and/or [[Heavy Drinking]], there are ways to retrigger it often enough that the damage could add up, especially along with multiple weapons.
